# ClinicHub API Response Schemas

This document provides detailed schemas for all API endpoints in ClinicHub. All responses are wrapped in a standard `ApiResponse<T>` container.

## 📦 Shared Structures

### Standard API Response Wrapper
```json
{
    "success": true,
    "errors": {
        "propertyName": [
            "Error message"
        ]
    },
    "data": T,
    "message": "Operation successful",
    "statusCode": 200
}
```

### Pagination Wrapper (`PagginatedResult<T>`)
```json
{
    "items": [T
    ],
    "pageNumber": 1,
    "pageSize": 20,
    "totalPages": 5,
    "totalCount": 100,
    "hasPreviousPage": false,
    "hasNextPage": true
}
```

---

## 🔐 Authentication & Profile (`/api/v1/auth`)

### 1. Signup / Register
**Endpoint:** `POST /api/v1/auth/signup`
**Response Data Type:** `AuthResponseDto`

```json
{
    "success": true,
    "errors": {},
    "data": {
        "accessToken": "string|null",
        "refreshToken": "string|null",
        "fullName": "string",
        "email": "string",
        "id": "guid",
        "verificationCode": "string|null"
    },
    "message": "User created successfully",
    "statusCode": 201
}
```

### 2. Verify User
**Endpoint:** `POST /api/v1/auth/verify`
**Response Data Type:** `string` (Success Message)

```json
{
    "success": true,
    "errors": {},
    "data": "Verification successful message",
    "message": "Operation successful",
    "statusCode": 200
}
```

### 3. Login
**Endpoint:** `POST /api/v1/auth/login`
**Response Data Type:** `AuthResponseDto`

```json
{
    "success": true,
    "errors": {},
    "data": {
        "accessToken": "string",
        "refreshToken": "string",
        "fullName": "string",
        "email": "string",
        "id": "guid",
        "verificationCode": null
    },
    "message": "Login successful",
    "statusCode": 200
}
```

### 4. Refresh Token
**Endpoint:** `POST /api/v1/auth/refresh-token`
**Response Data Type:** `RefreshTokenResponseDto`

```json
{
    "success": true,
    "errors": {},
    "data": {
        "accessToken": "string",
        "refreshToken": "string"
    },
    "message": "Tokens refreshed",
    "statusCode": 200
}
```

### 5. Forget Password
**Endpoint:** `POST /api/v1/auth/forget-password`
**Response Data Type:** `string`

```json
{
    "success": true,
    "errors": {},
    "data": "Check your email for reset instructions",
    "message": "Operation successful",
    "statusCode": 200
}
```

### 6. Verify Reset Token
**Endpoint:** `POST /api/v1/auth/verify-reset-token`
**Response Data Type:** `bool`

```json
{
    "success": true,
    "errors": {},
    "data": true,
    "message": "Token is valid",
    "statusCode": 200
}
```

### 7. Reset Password
**Endpoint:** `POST /api/v1/auth/reset-password`
**Response Data Type:** `string`

```json
{
    "success": true,
    "errors": {},
    "data": "Password changed successfully",
    "message": "Operation successful",
    "statusCode": 200
}
```

---

### 8. Get Profile
**Endpoint:** `GET /api/v1/auth/profile`
**Response Data Type:** `UserProfileDto`

```json
{
    "success": true,
    "errors": {},
    "data": {
        "id": "guid",
        "fullName": "string",
        "email": "string",
        "gender": 0,
        "phoneNumber": "string",
        "birthDate": "2024-04-24T15:00:00Z",
        "profilePictureUrl": "string|null"
    },
    "message": "Profile retrieved",
    "statusCode": 200
}
```

