## 🏥 Clinics (`/api/v1/clinics`)

### 1. Hybrid Search
**Endpoint:** `GET /api/v1/clinics/search`
**Response Data Type:** `PagginatedResult<ClinicDto>`

```json
{
    "success": true,
    "errors": {},
    "data": {
        "items": [
            {
                "id": "guid",
                "name": "string",
                "nameAr": "string",
                "address": "string",
                "addressAr": "string",
                "phone": "string",
                "lat": 0.0,
                "lng": 0.0,
                "isRegistered": false,
                "specializationName": "string",
                "distance": 0.0
            }
        ],
        "pageNumber": 1,
        "pageSize": 20,
        "totalPages": 1,
        "totalCount": 1
    },
    "message": "Search completed",
    "statusCode": 200
}
```

